# Chrome and navigation

Use `src/components/Nav.jsx` and `src/components/Footer.jsx`. Wrap case studies in `CaseStudyPage`.

## Contrast

White type is **only** legal on photography.

- Home hero: `<Nav tone="photo" />` while the floral hero is in view.
- Everywhere else (scrolled home, case studies, 404): `<Nav tone="light" />`.
- Footer always includes `footer-bg.png` and white type.

Do not paste a new nav/footer into a page.

## Routing

- About is the home hero (`id="about"`). Hash scroll lives in `useHashScroll`. There is no separate About section.
- Work is `#work`. Links use `to={{ pathname: '/', hash: 'work' }}`.
- Site name is `Link to="/"`.
- Resume always shows ↗ and `target="_blank"`.
- Never show `View case study →`. The title (and thumbnail) go to the case study. `View website ↗` is a text link under the tags, not a pill, only when a live URL exists.
